A first-block plus refuses a follower at an intervening column

```
- > +
 b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>+
b</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - > +
 b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+
b</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - > +
   b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+
b</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
> > +
  > q
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>+
&gt; q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
- a
  > > +
    > q
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote>
      <blockquote><p>+
&gt; q</p></blockquote>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
